::  mar/gall-leave: unsubscribe grubbery from a gall agent, tearing down
::  the /sys/gall/subs materialization its watch created. The agent
::  accepts this poke but the desk shipped no mark for it, so a
::  fiber-initiated leave crashed marc-not-found at the gall service.
::
|_  w=[ship=@p dude=@tas pax=path]
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  w
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  ,[ship=@p dude=@tas pax=path]
  --
--
